<title>AUSTRALIA: GIO appoints Stanley Howard chairman.</title>
<headline>GIO appoints Stanley Howard chairman.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insurer GIO Australia Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday its board of directors had elected Stanley Howard as chairman.</p>
<p>The appointment of Howard, who is chairman of a number of other listed companies, followed the death of John Iliffe on May 24.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
